        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cement plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cement plant
The lifespan of the infrastructure and the land occupation are assumed to be 50 years. The module is valid for a yearly production volume of 340'000 t/a;
Synonyms: Zementwerk, Cement plant; 
UUID: 30df91c3-fac6-3ccf-835b-71863079263a
includes the infrastructure (buildings, paved roads, etc.) and the land-use for the cement production, rotary kiln excluded (see "clinker, at plant
Location: For some exchanges RER-modules have been used as proxy
Technology: Average Swiss cement plant
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: most data measured by all Swiss plants (8 plants) 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_30df91c3-fac6-3ccf-835b-71863079263a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
